    "description": {
      "value": "These panpipes are made of what seems to be beat-up tin bound by frayed leather and look like they shouldn't function at all, but in skilled hands they emit a beautiful sound that beguiles the senses. While playing the pipes, you gain a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy and Performance checks.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\nThe item bonuses are +2.\n\n- - **4th:** confusion, suggestion\n- - **5th:** charm, glimmer of charm, suggestion, telepathy"
